		{
			dependencies: ["071A387593153E20"]
			description: [
				"This pack is currently &9very new&r, and I decided to make it public as early as I did to gain player feedback."
				"Every design decision in this pack has a specific reason for being the way that it is. If something feels out of place, refer to the &1Design Manifesto&r document in the Discord server. If it is not present in there, ask me about it directly, as it would be something I have yet to consider."
				""
				"The pack is built on community feedback that allows me to better formulate ideas, &oplease &rgive me any criticism or thoughts you have."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "gtceu:neutronium_wrench"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
					DisallowContainerItem: 0b
					GT.Behaviours: {
