		{
			dependencies: ["071A387593153E20"]
			description: [
				"This pack ships with some default config options, namely automatically having the Minecraft Seven Monospace font and C4Music resource packs enabled. I've also taken this opportunity to change some conflicting default keybinds. Highlights include:"
				"M - Fullscreen Map"
				"N - New Waypoint"
				"B - Open Backpack"
				"G - Toolbelt Radial Menu"
